     4931     run day-begin-fact-order in this-procedure ( input x-date-start, output v-fact-order-start ).
     4932     run day-begin-fact-order in this-procedure ( input ( x-date-end + 1 ),   output v-fact-order-end ).
     4933     define variable sz-qnty      as integer initial 3  no-undo .
